wiki/Quoyness_chambered_cairn]; It is located on the Elsness peninsula of Sanday, Orkney [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quoyness_chambered_cairn]; The cairn rests on an oval stone platform [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quoyness_chambered_cairn]; It was probably built around 3000 BC [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quoyness_chambered_cairn]; The bones of several people were found in it (during the excavation) in 1867 [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quoyness_chambered_cairn]"}]'::jsonb),
